#Marketing Campaign Performance Analysis

##Overview
This project analyzes the effectiveness of digital marketing campaigns using common business analytics metrics and statistical techniques.
The workflow includes campaign performance evaluation, KPI calculation, A/B testing, conversion funnel analysis, and short-term sales forecasting using ARIMA.

##Technologies
- Python
- Pandas
- NumPy
- Matplotlib
- SciPy
- Statsmodels

##Project Workflow
- Data cleaning and preprocessing
- KPI calculation
- Campaign aggregation
- CTR analysis
- Conversion Rate analysis
- ROI calculation
- A/B statistical testing
- Funnel visualization
- Purchase trend analysis
- ARIMA forecasting

##Key Metrics
- CTR
- Conversion Rate
- ROI
- Funnel conversion
- Statistical significance (Welch's t-test)

##Results
The analysis compares marketing campaign performance using business KPIs and statistical testing.
Additionally, a simplified conversion funnel illustrates user behavior across multiple stages, while ARIMA forecasting demonstrates short-term purchase prediction based on historical observations.
